	<div class="tile" data-replay-tile><p class="im-caption" data-index="02">line-up</p><p class="text-h2 font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink" data-im-in="line-up" style="min-height: 2.4em">Make it easy to read.</p><span class="text-sm">Rises from behind its own baseline, as if through a slot.</span></div>
	<div class="tile" data-replay-tile><p class="im-caption" data-index="03">blur-in</p><p class="text-h2 font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink" data-im-in="blur-in" style="min-height: 2.4em">Make it easy to read.</p><span class="text-sm">Comes into focus.</span></div>
	<div class="tile" data-replay-tile><p class="im-caption" data-index="04">track-in</p><p class="text-h2 font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink" data-im-in="track-in" style="min-height: 2.4em">Make it easy to read.</p><span class="text-sm">Letters close up from wide to set.</span></div>
	<div class="tile" data-replay-tile><p class="im-caption" data-index="05">type</p><p class="text-h2 font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink" data-im-in="type" style="min-height: 2.4em">Make it easy to read.</p><span class="text-sm">Wiped on in steps, like a line being typed.</span></div>
