	<div class="tile" data-replay-tile><p class="im-caption" data-index="11">iris</p><p class="text-h3 font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink im-out im-out-iris" style="--im-out-delay: 600ms">On its way out.</p><span class="text-sm">Closes to the centre.</span></div>
	<div class="tile" data-replay-tile><p class="im-caption" data-index="12">flip</p><p class="text-h3 font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink im-out im-out-flip" style="--im-out-delay: 600ms">On its way out.</p><span class="text-sm">Tips back off the page.</span></div>
